# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SablePay Example App - Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your credentials
#
# Get your credentials from: https://dashboard.sablepay.com/developers/api-keys
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Required: Your SablePay API Key
# Sandbox format: sable_sk_sand_xxxxx...
# Production format: sable_sk_live_xxxxx...
NEXT_PUBLIC_SABLEPAY_API_KEY=sable_sk_sand_xxx_xxx_xxxx_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Required: Your Merchant UUID
# Format: xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_SABLEPAY_MERCHANT_ID=39bxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxxxx-xxxxxx-xxxxxxxxxx

# Optional: API Base URL
# If omitted, the SDK picks one from the API key prefix:
#   Sandbox:    https://sandbox-app.sablepay.io/api/v1/
#   Production: https://app.sablepay.io/api/v1/
NEXT_PUBLIC_SABLEPAY_BASE_URL=https://sandbox.dvbouj5ym82y2.amplifyapp.com/api/v1/
